{
    "_comment": [
        "Only the components of the first switch board are listed. The key index",
        "is the position of the component within its category in the SMBIOS BOM",
        "string, so a single entry per BOM string slot is needed, whatever the",
        "number of the switch boards.",
        "The components of the other boards are derived by hw-management-devtree.sh",
        "from the config attributes written by pre_devtr_init(). For board B, from",
        "1 to swb_brd_num, the i2c bus of a component is its bus in this file plus",
        "the bus offset of its category multiplied by (B - 1): voltage regulators",
        "use swb_brd_bus_offset, hot-swap controllers use",
        "swb_brd_hotswap_bus_offset, power converters use",
        "swb_brd_pwr_conv_bus_offset and EEPROMs use swb_brd_eeprom_bus_offset.",
        "The trailing number of the component name is incremented in the same way,",
        "by the number of the components of that category on a single board:",
        "swb_brd_vr_num, swb_brd_hotswap_num or swb_brd_pwr_conv_num. EEPROM names",
        "have no trailing number, the board number is inserted after the board name",
        "prefix instead and is omitted for the first board.",
        "E.g. hotswap1 on bus 6 with swb_brd_num 2, swb_brd_hotswap_bus_offset 16",
        "and swb_brd_hotswap_num 1 also creates hotswap2 on bus 22, and swb_info on",
        "bus 13 with swb_brd_eeprom_bus_offset 16 also creates swb2_info on bus 29."
    ],
